// MODULE 15: Clearance (AUDIT-H3)
// Did not exist before this fix, despite THREE existing places assuming it
// did: students.service.ts's matriculate() seeds default clearance items
// (wrapped in try/catch anticipating "P5 migration pending" — that migration
// never actually landed), and report-generation.processor.ts's
// ReportType.CLEARANCE_STATUS case already queries studentClearance/
// clearanceItem directly with no defensive handling at all. Field names
// below match both of those existing call sites exactly, verified before
// writing this rather than guessed.
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

enum ClearanceStatus {
  PENDING
  CLEARED
  BLOCKED
  WAIVED
}

